{"about_the_game":"Set up shop and manage it in a relaxing city,<br>Get your hands on a fresh shop management simulator, start today!<br><br>This is a toned-down version of the Shop Life Simulator,<br><br>Manage the shop, Deal with other businesses, Hire Steve as employee, Sell or scratch lottery tickets and try your luck at winning big, in a complete shop simulation.<br><br>---( Wishlist and Follow )---<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459090/extras/title_ticket.png?t=1741063580\" /><br>Buy &amp; Sell scratch tickets and try your luck at winning those prizes<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459090/extras/Shop_ScratchLow.gif?t=1741063580\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459090/extras/title_247.png?t=1741063580\" /><br>Only if you choose to remain open and go through the night. There is an special attention to the nights to have their own <i>different</i> vibe than days.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459090/extras/title_management.png?t=1741063580\" /><br>Order and stock products, Hire staff, and organize your shelves for fast shopping by customers. <br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459090/extras/Shop_StockingLow.gif?t=1741063580\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459090/extras/title_grow.png?t=1741063580\" /><br>You start small, you can grow big, <i>physically</i> and <i>spiritually</i>. Buy places and storage locations to increase your fame and your customers.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459090/extras/Shop_CargoLow.gif?t=1741063580\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src